87. POINTER MEMORY MODEL
------------------------------------------------------------

Think in this pattern:

    Variable
       |
       | &
       v
    Address
       |
       v
    Pointer
       |
       | *
       v
    Original object

Example:

    int x = 100;
    int *p = &x;

Conceptually:

    x = 100

    &x
     |
     v

    p = address of x

    *p
     |
     v

    100

This model should become automatic in your mind.

