------------------------------------------------------------
Storage        actual elements     pointer object
sizeof         whole array size    pointer size
Assignment     cannot assign       can assign
arr++          invalid             valid if appropriate
arr = p        invalid             valid
p = arr        valid               valid

Remember:

    Array is NOT a pointer.

But array expressions often convert to a pointer to their first
element.

